</div><p style="font-size:.82rem;color:#4b5563;margin:0;line-height:1.6;">12mm cricket pitch mat PU-glued onto PCC pad. Seam tape applied on all joins.</p></div><div style="background:#fff;border:2px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:1.2rem;border-left:4px solid #c0392b;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;margin-bottom:.45rem;"><span style="background:#c0392b;color:#fff;width:25px;height:25px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:.8rem;flex-shrink:0;">7</span><h3 style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a2e;margin:0;">Outfield Turf and Infill</h3></div><p style="font-size:.82rem;color:#4b5563;margin:0;line-height:1.6;">PE carpet laid and seamed. Silica sand brushed in, then SBR rubber granules by power brush.</p></div><div style="background:#fff;border:2px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:1.2rem;border-left:4px solid #c0392b;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;margin-bottom:.45rem;"><span style="background:#c0392b;color:#fff;width:25px;height:25px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:.8rem;flex-shrink:0;">8</span><h3 style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a2e;margin:0;">LED Lighting</h3></div><p style="font-size:.82rem;color:#4b5563;margin:0;line-height:1.6;">Armored cable runs, MCB panel installation, floodlight mounting and lux measurement testing.</p></div><div style="background:#fff;border:2px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:1.2rem;border-left:4px solid #c0392b;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;margin-bottom:.45rem;"><span style="background:#c0392b;color:#fff;width:25px;height:25px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;font-size:.8rem;flex-shrink:0;">9</span><h3 style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a2e;margin:0;">Final Handover</h3></div><p style="font-size